 482:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         refer to description of each function for setting
 483:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         conditioned to ADC state.
 484:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   */
