2617:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
2618:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Helper macro to determine whether the selected channel
2619:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         corresponds to literal definitions of driver.
2620:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   The different literal definitions of ADC channels are:
2621:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC internal channel:
2622:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           LL_ADC_CHANNEL_VREFINT, LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TEMPSENSOR, ...
2623:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC external channel (channel connected to a GPIO pin):
2624:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           LL_ADC_CHANNEL_1, LL_ADC_CHANNEL_2, ...
2625:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   The channel parameter must be a value defined from literal
2626:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         definition of a ADC internal channel (LL_ADC_CHANNEL_VREFINT,
2627:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TEMPSENSOR, ...),
2628:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC external channel (LL_ADC_CHANNEL_1, LL_ADC_CHANNEL_2, ...),
2629:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         must not be a value from functions where a channel number is
2630:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         returned from ADC registers,
2631:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         because internal and external channels share the same channel
2632:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         number in ADC registers. The differentiation is made only with
2633:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         parameters definitions of driver.
2634:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  __CHANNEL__ This parameter can be one of the following values:
