2974:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Other channels are slow channels  allows: 6.5 (sampling) + 12.5 (conversion) = 19 A
2975:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             (fADC) to convert in 12-bit resolution.\n
