3428:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
3429:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Helper macro to calculate the temperature (unit: degree Celsius)
3430:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         from ADC conversion data of internal temperature sensor.
3431:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Computation is using temperature sensor calibration values
3432:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         stored in system memory for each device during production.
3433:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Calculation formula:
3434:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Temperature = ((TS_ADC_DATA - TS_CAL1)
3435:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                           * (TS_CAL2_TEMP - TS_CAL1_TEMP))
3436:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                         / (TS_CAL2 - TS_CAL1) + TS_CAL1_TEMP
3437:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           with TS_ADC_DATA = temperature sensor raw data measured by ADC
3438:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                Avg_Slope = (TS_CAL2 - TS_CAL1)
3439:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                            / (TS_CAL2_TEMP - TS_CAL1_TEMP)
3440:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                TS_CAL1   = equivalent TS_ADC_DATA at temperature
3441:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                            TEMP_DEGC_CAL1 (calibrated in factory)
3442:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                TS_CAL2   = equivalent TS_ADC_DATA at temperature
3443:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                            TEMP_DEGC_CAL2 (calibrated in factory)
3444:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Caution: Calculation relevancy under reserve that calibration
3445:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  parameters are correct (address and data).
3446:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  To calculate temperature using temperature sensor
3447:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  datasheet typical values (generic values less, therefore
3448:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  less accurate than calibrated values),
3449:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                  use helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_CALC_TEMPERATURE_TYP_PARAMS().
