3577:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
3578:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Function to help to configure DMA transfer from ADC: retrieve the
3579:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC register address from ADC instance and a list of ADC registers
3580:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         intended to be used (most commonly) with DMA transfer.
3581:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   These ADC registers are data registers:
3582:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         when ADC conversion data is available in ADC data registers,
3583:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC generates a DMA transfer request.
3584:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   This macro is intended to be used with LL DMA driver, refer to
3585:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         function "LL_DMA_ConfigAddresses()".
3586:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Example:
3587:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           LL_DMA_ConfigAddresses(DMA1,
3588:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                                  LL_DMA_CHANNEL_1,
3589:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                                  LL_ADC_DMA_GetRegAddr(ADC1, LL_ADC_DMA_REG_REGULAR_DATA),
3590:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                                  (uint32_t)&< array or variable >,
3591:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                                  LL_DMA_DIRECTION_PERIPH_TO_MEMORY);
3592:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   For devices with several ADC: in multimode, some devices
3593:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         use a different data register outside of ADC instance scope
3594:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (common data register). This macro manages this register difference,
3595:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         only ADC instance has to be set as parameter.
3596:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll DR       RDATA          LL_ADC_DMA_GetRegAddr\n
3597:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         CDR      RDATA_MST      LL_ADC_DMA_GetRegAddr\n
3598:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         CDR      RDATA_SLV      LL_ADC_DMA_GetRegAddr
