4244:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             (fADC) to convert in 12-bit resolution.\n
4245:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7) For ADC channel read back from ADC register,
