4774:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
4775:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set ADC group regular sequencer length and scan direction.
4776:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Description of ADC group regular sequencer features:
4777:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - For devices with sequencer fully configurable
4778:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           (function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerRanks()" available):
4779:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           sequencer length and each rank affectation to a channel
4780:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           are configurable.
4781:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           This function performs configuration of:
4782:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence length: Number of ranks in the scan sequence.
4783:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence direction: Unless specified in parameters, sequencer
4784:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             scan direction is forward (from rank 1 to rank n).
4785:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Sequencer ranks are selected using
4786:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerRanks()".
4787:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - For devices with sequencer not fully configurable
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccZi7HIl.s 			page 86


4788:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           (function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerChannels()" available):
4789:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           sequencer length and each rank affectation to a channel
4790:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           are defined by channel number.
4791:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           This function performs configuration of:
4792:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence length: Number of ranks in the scan sequence is
4793:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             defined by number of channels set in the sequence,
4794:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             rank of each channel is fixed by channel HW number.
4795:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             (channel 0 fixed on rank 0, channel 1 fixed on rank1, ...).
4796:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence direction: Unless specified in parameters, sequencer
4797:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             scan direction is forward (from lowest channel number to
4798:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             highest channel number).
4799:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Sequencer ranks are selected using
4800:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerChannels()".
4801:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Sequencer disabled is equivalent to sequencer of 1 rank:
