5172:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
5173:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set ADC continuous conversion mode on ADC group regular.
5174:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Description of ADC continuous conversion mode:
5175:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - single mode: one conversion per trigger
5176:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - continuous mode: after the first trigger, following
5177:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           conversions launched successively automatically.
5178:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   It is not possible to enable both ADC group regular
5179:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         continuous mode and sequencer discontinuous mode.
5180:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, setting of this feature is conditioned to
5181:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
5182:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC must be disabled or enabled without conversion on going
5183:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         on group regular.
