5893:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
5894:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set one context on ADC group injected that will be checked in
5895:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         contexts queue.
5896:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   A context is a setting of group injected sequencer:
5897:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - group injected trigger
5898:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - sequencer length
