5903:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         cannot be used):
5904:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to function @ref LL_ADC_INJ_SetQueueMode().
5905:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   In the contexts queue, only the active context can be read.
5906:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         The parameters of this function can be read using functions:
5907:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_INJ_GetTriggerSource()
5908:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_INJ_GetTriggerEdge()
5909:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_INJ_GetSequencerRanks()
5910:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, to measure internal channels (VrefInt,
5911:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TempSensor, ...), measurement paths to internal channels must be
