6213:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
6214:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set sampling time of the selected ADC channel
6215:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Unit: ADC clock cycles.
6216:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this device, sampling time is on channel scope: independently
6217:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         of channel mapped on ADC group regular or injected.
6218:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   In case of internal channel (VrefInt, TempSensor, ...) to be
6219:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         converted:
6220:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         sampling time constraints must be respected (sampling time can be
6221:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         adjusted in function of ADC clock frequency and sampling time
6222:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         setting).
6223:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to device datasheet for timings values (parameters TS_vrefint,
6224:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TS_temp, ...).
6225:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Conversion time is the addition of sampling time and processing time.
6226:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         On this STM32 series, ADC processing time is:
6227:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - 12.5 ADC clock cycles at ADC resolution 12 bits
6228:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - 10.5 ADC clock cycles at ADC resolution 10 bits
6229:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - 8.5 ADC clock cycles at ADC resolution 8 bits
6230:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - 6.5 ADC clock cycles at ADC resolution 6 bits
6231:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   In case of ADC conversion of internal channel (VrefInt,
6232:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         temperature sensor, ...), a sampling time minimum value
6233:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         is required.
6234:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to device datasheet.
6235:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, setting of this feature is conditioned to
6236:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
6237:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC must be disabled or enabled without conversion on going
6238:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         on either groups regular or injected.
