6333:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
6334:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Get sampling time of the selected ADC channel
6335:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Unit: ADC clock cycles.
6336:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this device, sampling time is on channel scope: independently
6337:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         of channel mapped on ADC group regular or injected.
6338:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Conversion time is the addition of sampling time and processing time.
6339:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         On this STM32 series, ADC processing time is:
6340:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - 12.5 ADC clock cycles at ADC resolution 12 bits
6341:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - 10.5 ADC clock cycles at ADC resolution 10 bits
6342:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - 8.5 ADC clock cycles at ADC resolution 8 bits
6343:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - 6.5 ADC clock cycles at ADC resolution 6 bits
