6731:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Get ADC analog watchdog monitored channel.
6732:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Usage of the returned channel number:
6733:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - To reinject this channel into another function LL_ADC_xxx:
6734:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           the returned channel number is only partly formatted on definition
6735:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           of literals LL_ADC_CHANNEL_x. Therefore, it has to be compared
6736:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           with parts of literals LL_ADC_CHANNEL_x or using
6737:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TO_DECIMAL_NB().
6738:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Then the selected literal LL_ADC_CHANNEL_x can be used
6739:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           as parameter for another function.
6740:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - To get the channel number in decimal format:
6741:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           process the returned value with the helper macro
6742:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           @ref __LL_ADC_CHANNEL_TO_DECIMAL_NB().
6743:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Applicable only when the analog watchdog is set to monitor
6744:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           one channel.
6745:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, there are 2 kinds of analog watchdog
6746:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         instance:
6747:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - AWD standard (instance AWD1):
6748:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - channels monitored: can monitor 1 channel or all channels.
6749:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - groups monitored: ADC groups regular and-or injected.
6750:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - resolution: resolution is not limited (corresponds to
6751:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             ADC resolution configured).
6752:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - AWD flexible (instances AWD2, AWD3):
6753:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - channels monitored: flexible on channels monitored, selection is
6754:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             channel wise, from from 1 to all channels.
6755:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Specificity of this analog watchdog: Multiple channels can
6756:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             be selected. For example:
6757:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             (LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL4_REG_INJ | LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL5_REG_INJ | ...)
6758:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - groups monitored: not selection possible (monitoring on both
6759:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             groups regular and injected).
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccZi7HIl.s 			page 125


6760:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Channels selected are monitored on groups regular and injected:
6761:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_REG_INJ (do not use parameters
6762:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_REG and LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_INJ)
6763:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - resolution: resolution is limited to 8 bits: if ADC resolution is
6764:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             12 bits the 4 LSB are ignored, if ADC resolution is 10 bits
6765:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             the 2 LSB are ignored.
6766:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, setting of this feature is conditioned to
6767:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
6768:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC must be disabled or enabled without conversion on going
6769:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         on either groups regular or injected.
