7167:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
7168:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set ADC oversampling scope: ADC groups regular and-or injected
7169:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (availability of ADC group injected depends on STM32 series).
7170:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   If both groups regular and injected are selected,
7171:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         specify behavior of ADC group injected interrupting
7172:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         group regular: when ADC group injected is triggered,
7173:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         the oversampling on ADC group regular is either
7174:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         temporary stopped and continued, or resumed from start
7175:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (oversampler buffer reset).
7176:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, setting of this feature is conditioned to
7177:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
7178:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC must be disabled or enabled without conversion on going
7179:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         on either groups regular or injected.
7180:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll CFGR2    ROVSE          LL_ADC_SetOverSamplingScope\n
7181:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         CFGR2    JOVSE          LL_ADC_SetOverSamplingScope\n
