7511:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   The sampling delay range depends on ADC resolution:
7512:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC resolution 12 bits can have maximum delay of 12 cycles.
7513:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC resolution 10 bits can have maximum delay of 10 cycles.
7514:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC resolution  8 bits can have maximum delay of  8 cycles.
7515:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC resolution  6 bits can have maximum delay of  6 cycles.
7516:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, setting of this feature is conditioned to
7517:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
7518:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         All ADC instances of the ADC common group must be disabled.
7519:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         This check can be done with function @ref LL_ADC_IsEnabled() for each
7520:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC instance or by using helper macro helper macro
7521:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @ref __LL_ADC_IS_ENABLED_ALL_COMMON_INSTANCE().
7522:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll CCR      DELAY          LL_ADC_SetMultiTwoSamplingDelay
7523:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  ADCxy_COMMON ADC common instance
7524:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (can be set directly from CMSIS definition or by using helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_COMMO
