 968:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c **** /**
 969:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @brief  Stop multimode ADC conversion, disable ADC DMA transfer, disable ADC peripheral.
 970:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   Multimode is kept enabled after this function. MultiMode DMA bits
 971:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         (MDMA and DMACFG bits of common CCR register) are maintained. To disable
