1124:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @brief  Get ADC injected group conversion result.
1125:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   Reading register JDRx automatically clears ADC flag JEOC
1126:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         (ADC group injected end of unitary conversion).
1127:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   This function does not clear ADC flag JEOS
1128:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         (ADC group injected end of sequence conversion)
1129:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         Occurrence of flag JEOS rising:
1130:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *          - If sequencer is composed of 1 rank, flag JEOS is equivalent
1131:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *            to flag JEOC.
1132:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *          - If sequencer is composed of several ranks, during the scan
1133:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *            sequence flag JEOC only is raised, at the end of the scan sequence
1134:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *            both flags JEOC and EOS are raised.
1135:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         Flag JEOS must not be cleared by this function because
1136:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         it would not be compliant with low power features
1137:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         (feature low power auto-wait, not available on all STM32 series).
1138:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         To clear this flag, either use function:
1139:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         in programming model IT: @ref HAL_ADC_IRQHandler(), in programming
1140:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         model polling: @ref HAL_ADCEx_InjectedPollForConversion()
1141:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         or @ref __HAL_ADC_CLEAR_FLAG(&hadc, ADC_FLAG_JEOS).
1142:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @param hadc ADC handle
1143:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @param InjectedRank the converted ADC injected rank.
