2098:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c **** 
2099:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c **** #if defined(ADC_MULTIMODE_SUPPORT)
2100:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c **** /**
2101:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @brief  Enable ADC multimode and configure multimode parameters
2102:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   Possibility to update parameters on the fly:
2103:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         This function initializes multimode parameters, following
2104:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         calls to this function can be used to reconfigure some parameters
2105:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         of structure "ADC_MultiModeTypeDef" on the fly, without resetting
2106:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         the ADCs.
2107:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         The setting of these parameters is conditioned to ADC state.
2108:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         For parameters constraints, see comments of structure
2109:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         "ADC_MultiModeTypeDef".
2110:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   To move back configuration from multimode to single mode, ADC must
