2332:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c **** /**
2333:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @brief  Enter ADC deep-power-down mode
2334:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   This mode is achieved in setting DEEPPWD bit and allows to save power
2335:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         in reducing leakage currents. It is particularly interesting before
2336:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         entering stop modes.
2337:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   Setting DEEPPWD automatically clears ADVREGEN bit and disables the
2338:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         ADC voltage regulator. This means that this API encompasses
2339:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         HAL_ADCEx_DisableVoltageRegulator(). Additionally, the internal
2340:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         calibration is lost.
2341:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   * @note   To exit the ADC deep-power-down mode, the user is expected to
2342:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         resort to HAL_ADC_Init() API as well as to relaunch a calibration
2343:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         with HAL_ADCEx_Calibration_Start() API or to re-apply a previously
2344:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc_ex.c ****   *         saved calibration factor.
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccZi7HIl.s 			page 319


